  // corner instead of batting it away (F-207, tuned so that no class is spun by a glance at any speed).
  // They give (F-308): a tyre is light enough that a car's corner sends it aside instead of being turned by it,
  // has room to get out of the way of a clip that puts up to 4 cm of it in the car's path, and is taken home
  // slowly enough not to bounce (damping 1.4 times critical). At the end of its travel it is the post it was.
  marker: { friction: 0.6, restitution: 0.1, massKg: 0.1, springNPerM: 20, dampingNsPerM: 4, travelM: 0.24 },
